 "id": "def-sp-double-complex-vertical-window",
 "kind": "definition",
 "title": "Smart vertical interval truncation",
 "statement": "Let C be an abelian category. For integers a,b, W[a,b) is the functor on nonnegative cochain complexes obtained by extension by zero to the integers, smart truncation from below at a, smart truncation from above at b-1, and restriction to nonnegative degrees. It preserves zero morphisms and hence acts columnwise on double complexes.",
